Binary location: target/release/k2i Source builds require Rust 1.94+, CMake, and OpenSSL development libraries. Kerberos/GSSAPI support is not enabled by default; if you need it, add the gssapi feature to rdkafka and install the matching SASL development libraries for your platform.
---
K2I separates hot and cold visibility: Hot-path visibility is local and intended for co-located readers or sidecars. Cold-path visibility depends on flush thresholds, object-store writes, and Iceberg catalog commit timing.
